<LegalPage title="Refunds & purchase recovery" description="How to recover a Flicksy purchase or request a refund." updated="September 3, 2026">
  <h2>Direct purchases</h2>
  <p>Use <a href="https://app.lemonsqueezy.com/my-orders">Lemon Squeezy My Orders</a> to recover your order details and license key. Direct refund requests follow the refund terms shown at checkout. If a refunded license is disabled, connected installations lose access when validation next succeeds.</p>

  <h2>Mac App Store purchases</h2>
  <p>Choose Restore Purchases inside Flicksy while signed in to the Apple Account that made the purchase. Apple processes App Store refund requests through <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/">Report a Problem</a>.</p>

  <h2>No cross-store recovery</h2>
  <p>A direct key cannot restore an App Store purchase, and an Apple Account cannot restore a direct purchase.</p>
</LegalPage>
